WEBVTT

1
00:00:14.420 --> 00:00:18.860
NARRATOR: Desiree is seventeen and has
been in foster care since she was eleven.

2
00:00:19.020 --> 00:00:21.680
She turns eighteen in six weeks.

3
00:00:22.200 --> 00:00:26.080
Today, she meets her caseworker
to discuss her transition plan.

4
00:00:26.140 --> 00:00:27.560
DESIREE: Can we make this quick?

5
00:00:27.670 --> 00:00:30.000
I already know what you're going to say.

6
00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:34.940
(sighs) Extended care, the
transitional living program, all of it.

7
00:00:35.320 --> 00:00:38.380
I don't want it.
Five placements in six years.

8
00:00:38.800 --> 00:00:42.580
I'm done. And I've got a plan.

9
00:00:42.900 --> 00:00:45.580
When I turn eighteen,
I'm moving in with Jay.

10
00:00:45.780 --> 00:00:49.780
He's twenty-six, he has his
own place, he has a real job.

11
00:00:49.860 --> 00:00:51.600
We've been talking for, like, two months.

12
00:00:52.020 --> 00:00:53.400
He actually listens to me.

13
00:00:53.640 --> 00:00:55.050
He's the only one who does.

14
00:00:55.100 --> 00:00:59.220
So you don't need to worry about me.
I'm fine.

15
00:00:59.360 --> 00:01:01.820
Can you just sign
whatever you need to sign?

16
00:01:02.220 --> 00:01:04.300
NARRATOR: Desiree has told you her plan.

17
00:01:04.400 --> 00:01:08.480
Do you ask about Jay, or move
on to her transition paperwork?
